# Seller (src/counterparty/seller.ts). Copy to env/seller.env. Holds no keys and no bearer tokens.
NETWORK=local
# set me: payTo address (local: account #3 from .local/deployment.json)
SELLER_PAY_TO=
# optional; local default http://127.0.0.1:4022, base-sepolia default https://x402.org/facilitator
# FACILITATOR_URL=
# optional; default 4021
# SELLER_PORT=
#
# Base Sepolia (CP-3): set NETWORK=base-sepolia and SELLER_PAY_TO to your own address.
# No local facilitator runs; FACILITATOR_URL defaults to https://x402.org/facilitator, which pays gas.
# The payer (L2's PAYER_PRIVATE_KEY, in env/l2-control.env only) must hold test USDC
# from https://faucet.circle.com. Base Sepolia USDC's EIP-712 name is "USDC", not "USD Coin".
